<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse trade resumes for 10 mins at 1700 GM.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse trade resumes for 10 mins at 1700 GM.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lisbon bourse trade, which was interrupted shortly before the close because of technical problems, will resume for 10 minutes from 1700 GMT, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
